-- Update 1.5: Caverns bosses, new player protection, banned skills and fixes.
-- The update posts in Announcements, Server Updates and Changelog.
-- Generated by scripts/build-pages.mjs from scripts/guide-data.mjs. Only adds what is missing.

INSERT INTO forum_posts (category_id, title, body, author_name, pinned, published, published_at)
SELECT id, 'Update 1.5 is LIVE: Caverns Bosses & More', '**The Caverns just got deadlier!** Bosses now guard the deep, and everything you do down there still pays **cash**.

- **Caverns bosses** have their own spots, with their real name floating above them and a countdown when they''re slain.
- **Random Boss spots:** a different boss turns up each time. Watch for **☠ Random Boss ☠ Arrives in**.
- **Up to 7 layers of armour:** doing no damage? You have to break through the armour first. This is **end-game content**, so gear up and team up.
- **Kill for cash:** every mob, boss and node in the Caverns pays **$100 to $10,000**.
- **New players are protected:** no damage while picking your race, and for your first 15 minutes below level 5.
- **Some overpowered skills are now banned** and are removed automatically.

Type **/warp caverns** to jump in, or **/caverns** to see your trackers.

[Read the full patch notes](/forums?c=server-updates) · [Caverns guide](/guide#caverns)', 'OVERTHRONE Staff', 1, 1, strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ', 'now')
FROM forum_categories
WHERE slug = 'announcements'
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM forum_posts WHERE title = 'Update 1.5 is LIVE: Caverns Bosses & More');
INSERT INTO forum_posts (category_id, title, body, author_name, pinned, published, published_at)
SELECT id, 'Update 1.5: Caverns Bosses & More', '## ⛏ The Caverns (a reminder)
The Caverns (**/warp caverns**) are a deep mine full of **mobs**, **bosses** and **every kind of gathering node**. No level needed.
- Every **mob kill**, **boss kill** and **node** you gather in the Caverns pays **$100 to $10,000**. Stronger mobs and higher-level nodes pay more, and bosses pay the most.
- Kills and nodes still give **Combat**, **profession** and **level XP**.
- Talk to the **Cavern Guide** NPC or type **/caverns** for your trackers: mobs killed, bosses slain, nodes gathered, cash earned, best payout and time spent.
- There''s a per-minute limit on Caverns cash, so farms can''t print money.

## ☠ Caverns Bosses
- Bosses now have **their own spots** in the Caverns, with their **real name** floating above them.
- When a boss is slain, a **countdown** and a **red timer bar** show when it''s back.
- Chat tells everyone when a boss is **slain** and when it **returns**.
- Bosses stay on their spot, and Caverns mobs are pulled back if they wander, so they can''t be dragged out.

## 🎲 Random Boss Spots
- Some spots hold **a different boss each time**. Floating text shows **☠ Random Boss ☠ Arrives in** with a timer (about every 30 minutes).
- Every boss on that spot appears **once before any repeats**, and never the same one twice in a row.

## 🛡 Boss Armour: Read This!
- **Doing no damage to a boss? It''s not a bug.** Caverns bosses have **up to 7 layers of armour** that you must break before your hits start to hurt them.
- This is **end-game content**. Bring your best gear and team up. Look for the warning boards in the boss area.
- Bosses no longer have the **Nullification** or **Regeneration** skills, so every boss can be beaten.

## 💎 Gathering Nodes
- Nodes now show **⚒ Hit 3x to gather** and a **progress bar** (on the floating text and above your hotbar) so you can see how many hits are left.

## 🐣 New Player Protection
- You can''t take damage **while picking your race**.
- After that you''re protected for your **first 15 minutes** while you''re **below level 5**. A timer above your hotbar shows how long is left.

## 🚫 Banned Skills
These skills are too strong and are now **banned**: **Predator, Gluttony, Creator, Fusionist, Infinity Prison, Cultivator, Pride, Jinchuriki, Crasher, Coalescence** and **Victorious Harbinger**.
- They can no longer be rolled as starting skills.
- Anyone who has one loses it automatically (when you log in, or within 30 seconds of getting it).

## ⚖ Balance
- **Direwolves** were killing new players: they now have **5 health** and their hits are capped at **2 damage**.

## 🛠 Fixes
- Races that start in their own world (like **Daemon** and **Angel**) are no longer pulled to the hub after picking their race.
- **Seris** gives the race scroll again.
- Hub and RPG world protection is stronger: skills can''t break anything there.

[Caverns guide](/guide#caverns) · [Professions guide](/guide#professions)', 'OVERTHRONE Staff', 1, 1, strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ', 'now')
FROM forum_categories
WHERE slug = 'server-updates'
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM forum_posts WHERE title = 'Update 1.5: Caverns Bosses & More');
INSERT INTO forum_posts (category_id, title, body, author_name, pinned, published, published_at)
SELECT id, 'Changelog: Update 1.5 (Caverns Bosses)', '## Added
- Caverns bosses with their own spots, real-name floating text, a respawn countdown and timer bar, and chat messages when a boss is slain or returns.
- Random Boss spots: a different boss each time (about every 30 minutes), each boss once per cycle, never the same twice in a row.
- Warning boards in the Caverns boss area: bosses have up to 7 layers of armour.
- New player protection: no damage while picking your race, and for the first 15 minutes below level 5.
- Banned skills: Predator, Gluttony, Creator, Fusionist, Infinity Prison, Cultivator, Pride, Jinchuriki, Crasher, Coalescence and Victorious Harbinger are removed automatically.
- Node progress bar: "Hit 3x to gather" and a bar showing your hits.

## Changed
- Direwolves: 5 health, and each hit is capped at 2 damage.
- Banned skills can''t be rolled as starting skills any more.
- Bosses no longer have Nullification or Regeneration.
- Caverns mobs and bosses are kept on their spot.

## Fixed
- Daemon, Angel and other races that start in their own world were pulled to the hub after picking their race.
- Seris didn''t give the race scroll.
- Skills could still break blocks in the hub and the RPG world.', 'OVERTHRONE Staff', 0, 1, strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ', 'now')
FROM forum_categories
WHERE slug = 'changelog'
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM forum_posts WHERE title = 'Changelog: Update 1.5 (Caverns Bosses)');

-- The Caverns Guide post gets the new boss info, only if nobody has edited it in /admin since Update 1.4.
UPDATE forum_posts SET body = '## The Caverns
A deep mine full of mobs, bosses and every kind of gathering node. No level needed, and everything you do down there pays cash.

- **/warp caverns**: Go to the Caverns
- **/caverns**: Your Caverns menu and trackers

- **Mobs** (Kill for cash): Every mob you kill in the Caverns pays **cash** and gives **Combat XP**. Stronger mobs pay more.
- **Bosses** (Up to $10,000): Bosses lurk in the deep. They have **up to 7 layers of armour** to break before they take damage, so bring your best gear and some friends. They pay the most.
- **Nodes** (Every type): Mining, Gemology, Farming and Foraging nodes are all down here. Gathering one pays **cash** plus profession XP.

- **Cash:** every kill and every node in the Caverns pays **$100 to $10,000**. Stronger mobs and higher-level nodes pay more.
- **There''s a per-minute limit** on Caverns cash, so mob farms can''t print money.
- **Trackers:** talk to the **Cavern Guide** NPC or type **/caverns** to see your kills, bosses slain, nodes gathered, cash earned, best payout and time spent.
- **No level requirement:** anyone can go. Your profession level still has to be at least a node''s level to gather it.
- **Boss spots:** each boss has its own spot with its **real name** floating above it. When it''s slain, a countdown shows when it''s back, and chat tells everyone when a boss is slain or returns.
- **Random Boss spots:** some spots hold a different boss each time. The floating text shows **☠ Random Boss ☠ Arrives in** with a timer. Every boss on that spot shows up once before any repeats, and never the same one twice in a row.
- **Mobs and bosses stay home:** they''re pulled back to their spot if they wander, so you can''t drag them out of the Caverns.

**Doing no damage to a boss?** That''s not a bug. Caverns bosses have up to **7 layers of armour** that must be broken before your hits hurt them. This is **end-game content**: bring your best gear and team up.

Gathering works the same as everywhere else: hit a node **3 times** (the floating text shows your progress). It comes back after **1 minute**.

[Open the full Player Guide](/guide#caverns)' WHERE title = 'The Caverns Guide' AND body = '## The Caverns
